---
date added: 2026-11-08
title: Mom's Flank Steak
author: Mom
source: Handwritten family recipe card
tags: beef, flank steak, marinade, broiled
notes: Transcribed from a handwritten recipe card ("Flank Marinade"). Marinate 4 or more hours.
---

Combine @flank steak{2%lb}, @soy sauce{1/4%cup}, @honey{3%tbsp}, @vinegar or sherry burgundy{2%tbsp}, @garlic powder{1.5%tbsp}, @ground ginger{1.5%tsp}, @salad oil{3/4%cup} and @onion{}(finely chopped) and marinate for ~{4%hours} or more.

Broil for ~{5%minutes} on each side for rare.
